{"about_the_game":"<strong>Asemblance is a single-player, first-person, psychological thriller.</strong><br><br>You wake to find yourself trapped inside an experimental machine...<br>A machine built to simulate memories.<br>You no longer recall why you entered, but an AI voice guides you.<br>Trying to escape, you face memories from a past you may not want to remember.<br>But what is real?<br>Are these memories your own?<br>Can you even trust your own mind anymore?<br>Are you even in control?<br><br>Asemblance is the pilot episode of a mind-bending franchise inspired by The Twilight<br>Zone, The X-Files, and the Black Mirror television series.<br><br>Soundtrack by Seattle electronic artists Kid Smpl and Johnny Goss.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Loop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/452970/9920ca23f2eac132d65916beec2b63d056cd9ed7.jpg"},{"name":"AI Shutdown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/452970/fbe2beb46539ac68adde8c2d28381741bee09fa2.jpg"},{"name":"Nice Try","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/452970/b7a1d583e5e401a11cbb7bd82d6d8563a01a85db.jpg"},{"name":"Your Mind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/452970/cfa322533b50ec45f5543beda5782f91045d31a6.jpg"},{"name":"The \"Truth\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/452970/c173c179d3c234a2c3b00a5699d9b841fdd19a64.jpg"},{"name":"Blue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/452970/81871cfbb4ad2a563b2a04c2386d34e013132219.jpg"},{"name":"Green","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/452970/abcfe2baea14764f9e1578cec4a6f08d76ba8a39.jpg"},{"name":"White","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/452970/00283b93091ca1d9b2743f80a70ad65147e30b2e.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akam